From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Topher Campbell <chrs2021@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 18/23] pmdomain: mediatek: add the MT6771 with its modem domain

The MT6771's power controller has the MT8183's domains and the modem's
(MD1). The modem's sequence differs from the others (MediaTek's
clk-mt6771-pg.c and md_sys1_platform.c): its clocks leave gating in
TOPCKGEN's CLK_MODE first, its SRAM powers up with no ack before the
isolation is released, an extra isolation for its buck goes last, and the
bus protection is released without waiting; power off is the reverse.
The binding gains mediatek,mt6771-power-controller and the
mediatek,topckgen phandle the modem domain needs.
---
